WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:11.177
The feds were interested in
taking down the whole mafia.

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:13.913
I'm just one more guy
putting a piece of the puzzle

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.914
together for them.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:20.086
This special agent was
gonna be my handler.

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:23.857
He gave me this small recorder,
and it went into a jockstrap.

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:26.292
And he's like, yeah, just put
it on over your underwear.

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:27.894
You have to record everybody.

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:29.929
There's no exceptions.

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:32.766
I mean, he started
going over rules.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:34.134
Can't leave the wire.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.870
No violent, none at all.

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:39.038
Otherwise, the deal's off.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:42.609
He gave me my code
name, Break Shot.

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:46.146
Break Shot is the first
shot in a pool game

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.847
when they spread
out all the balls,

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:50.049
and that's basically what
they wanted me to do--

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:54.320
help smash the mob into pieces.

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:57.690
The deal was six
months to a year,

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:00.627
but I knew my life was
about to change forever.

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:06.866
The first time I
was wearing a wire,

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:10.904
I was going to meet a capo named
Jimmy Katchi, a very powerful

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.839
captain in the Colombo Family.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:16.109
Contrary to popular belief,
there is no agents waiting

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:19.145
in a van around the corner.

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:22.081
When they pressed the
button, I realized

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.517
that I was about
to go out, and I'm

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:28.421
gonna record one of the most
dangerous men in the world.

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:34.928
I thought in my
head, this is it.

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:36.162
This is for real.

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:39.199
[music playing]

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.435
Wearing a wire, you
think that everyone can

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:43.803
see that thing in your pocket.

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.673
[music continues]

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:51.177
Hey, Kenji, how you doing?

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:52.545
Sit down, sit down.

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.614
KENJI (VOICEOVER): I
sit down at the table.

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:03.723
And in walks this big, Italian
guy who I've never seen before.

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:07.494
He identified on tape.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.529
He said, I'm a wise
guy just like Jimmy.

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:16.870
He starts talking about the
inner workings of the mafia.

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:22.141
He wants to propose a guy into
the organization from Vegas.

00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:28.281
And I'm just
sitting there still,

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:31.117
hoping that the recorder
is picking up every word

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:32.385
because I know it's good.

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:38.658
He talked about the
organization structure,

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:40.527
and this is what
the FBI is after.

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:44.430
This is the kind of
evidence that they want.

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:47.066
And then, I start to feel
this warm sensation coming

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:50.236
from the recorder,
but I just kinda

00:02:50.303 --> 00:02:54.474
blow it off because the
guy is talking a lot.

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:55.842
I want to let things unfold.

00:03:02.215 --> 00:03:04.150
And I'm looking at him,
and it's starting to get

00:03:04.217 --> 00:03:07.787
hotter and hotter and hotter.

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:12.892
I'm realizing that this thing is
starting to burn in my crotch.

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:13.893
You OK?

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:20.166
All of a sudden, it
just gets unbearable.

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:23.036
Finally, I just
told him I gotta go.

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:26.172
[music playing]

00:03:31.778 --> 00:03:32.812
I met up with my handler.

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:39.352
He asked me, so what happened?

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:42.155
And I told him it
was burning so hot,

00:03:42.221 --> 00:03:45.858
I thought my nuts were on fire.

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:48.061
He just started laughing.

00:03:48.127 --> 00:03:49.495
He's like oh, I
heard that sometimes

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:51.798
they malfunction like that.

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:57.537
But I was relieved because he
told me that the tape was good.

00:03:57.604 --> 00:04:00.506
It was valuable because it would
help them find the structure

00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:02.208
and figure out who's doing what.

00:04:06.379 --> 00:04:10.016
As time went on, I
started to get it down.

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:13.119
[indistinct chattering]

00:04:14.721 --> 00:04:17.724
I learned how to elicit
what I wanted out of people.

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:21.027
Your business-- you bring
it to me, I get it done.

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:23.396
Hey, bartender,
another drink over here.

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:27.033
But the fear never goes.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:30.269
You always have to worry
about being found out.

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:34.841
Almost every single
person I knew

00:04:34.907 --> 00:04:38.211
had been involved in a murder
at one point or another,

00:04:38.277 --> 00:04:41.881
and I was gathering intel
on them for the FBI.

00:04:41.948 --> 00:04:45.885
I started seeing that I could
actually make a difference.

00:04:50.356 --> 00:04:52.158
That encouraged me to
do more because I felt

00:04:52.225 --> 00:04:53.593
like I accomplished something.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.228
Raise it to five.

00:04:55.294 --> 00:04:58.197
At this point, I'd been
undercover for six months.

00:04:58.264 --> 00:04:59.799
I was supposed to
be wearing a wire,

00:04:59.866 --> 00:05:05.705
but I decided to continue on
because I began to feel a lot

00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:07.273
of pride in what I was doing.

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:13.846
[music playing]

00:05:15.581 --> 00:05:20.553
The FBI wanted me to
aim higher, go bigger.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:25.058
And I knew that meant
the New York families.

00:05:25.124 --> 00:05:27.026
It's the epicenter of the mafia.

00:05:27.093 --> 00:05:30.730
It's where the power is.

00:05:30.797 --> 00:05:35.201
So I made a trip to New York.

00:05:35.268 --> 00:05:37.770
That's when I met
Eddie Garafolo.

00:05:37.837 --> 00:05:39.072
My guy, Kenji.

00:05:39.138 --> 00:05:40.473
Good to meet you.

00:05:42.575 --> 00:05:47.180
Eddie Garafolo was a Columbo
associate from New York,

00:05:47.246 --> 00:05:49.449
and he was very well connected.

00:05:52.418 --> 00:05:58.257
And he wanted me to move to
Brooklyn and be in his crew.

00:05:58.324 --> 00:06:00.593
And being invited there
was a huge step up.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:03.963
This was my chance to get
intel on the real big fish

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.098
in the mafia.

00:06:08.401 --> 00:06:12.939
But I had no idea what I
was getting myself into.

00:06:13.005 --> 00:06:16.209
[music playing]

